ly conceding, Kuro puts her gun away and starts sorting her gear."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.2","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MDR_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Kuro","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Incendiaries, spare mags..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-P90_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Mityl","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Here, take this."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MDR_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kuro","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Huh?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Kuro looks surprised as Mityl hands her a medkit and some painkillers."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-P90_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Mityl","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Why don't you carry any meds? Here, take mine."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Apparently unused to situations like this, Kuro accepts the gesture but doesn't know where to put it—her gear rig is already packed with ammo."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MDR_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kuro","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Thanks, but I'm used to it. If I don't have meds... I'll just knock out the enemy and take theirs!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"She hands the kit back, scratching her head."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Once the boat sets sail again, we lower the lifeboat from the stern and slip away under cover of night."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-P90_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Mityl","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Sounds good."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-MDR_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kuro","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Sure... But are we really just gonna leave?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-P90_AB","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Mityl","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yeah. We might still have a bit of time."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"A sigh escapes someone's lips—followed by a low chuckle."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_weapon_reload","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander looks at the two girls, now fully armed and visibly prepared for combat, and feels a strange mix of emotion."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I know what you're both thinking. Let's split up..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]}]}
